WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.570
Another use of the latch
tool is for binding off.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.050
Knit the last row of your knitting
at the loosest tension,

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.610
or manually knit a loose row.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.410
Slip the first stitch off the needle
and place it on the tool,

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.650
behind the latch of the tool.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:24.130
Slip the adjacent stitch
to the tool in the hook on the tool.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.650
Pull the second stitch through the first.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:33.400
This is called a stitch-through stitch bind off.
Method is fast, but it may not

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.530
be as stretchy as you need.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.760
Please try other bind-off
methods in addition to this one.

